{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>O.M.N.I.S.: Overnight Train</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re aboard a train that never stops.<br>Each carriage is part of a repeating routine \u2014 but something feels off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your surroundings closely.<br>Find anomalies.<br>Respond to the unusual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>O.M.N.I.S. \u2013 Overnight Train</strong> is a short, atmospheric walking simulator with psychological undertones.<br>Inspired by late-night train rides, liminal spaces, and the sense of being caught in an endless loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game about repetition, perception, and losing control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately <strong>15\u201330 minutes</strong><br>If you\u2019re observant and spot all anomalies.<br>Otherwise, the ride may take considerably longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Languages:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>English only</strong><br>No extensive language skills required \u2014 all hints are visual and intuitive.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The End?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3087790/356ebdbe0c550131954b15f1c04f8996ce0d61ff.jpg"},{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3087790/c2620f1fcb2752fc992b8af70800c2bafe56ea2f.jpg"},{"name":"Anomaly Whisperer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3087790/efbad05bba064f4dc53e66752ff9ae63e65e82a2.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3087790?t=1755338397","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgroun